WEBVTT

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:18.790
Grandpa...

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:20.450
Wh-What's going on?

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:22.910
Is this...

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:25.790
an attack from outside?

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:30.260
The outer wall of Block 95 is at damage level 7.

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:33.510
We can't maintain the colony's life support systems!

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:36.300
What's happening with the colony's rotation control systems?

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:39.970
Response teams, get a move on!

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:39.970
Commander Bruzar! Please authorize launch orders for the Diva!{white base/archangel anyone?}

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:44.600
The Diva, huh? That's the new battleship currently in port.

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:48.480
With that ship and the Gundam, we stand a chance against the UE!

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:50.780
But the Gundam is...

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:53.030
We have an urgent alert from the surveillance program!{program seems weird, they say program in english so we cant really change it, you could say automated alert i guess}

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:56.780
The explosions have produced abnormal vibrations within the colony.

00:00:56.780 --> 00:01:00.330
At this rate, Nora will undergo torsional collapse within 6 hours.

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:01.620
What?!

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.080
I'll prepare the escape crafts right away!

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:05.500
It's too late for that!

00:01:07.130 --> 00:01:09.840
Each escape craft can only carry 100 people.

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:12.380
Who knows how long a full evacuation would take!

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:14.300
But then...

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.470
Battleship Diva, prepare for launch!

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:23.810
Contact Captain Dian Fonroid!

00:01:23.810 --> 00:01:24.520
Roger that!

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:26.190
Commander...

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:28.190
We're not sending it out into combat.

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:32.690
We're using that ship to save the residents of Nora...

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:34.570
That newly-built battleship!

00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:42.120
It is the space age, hundreds of years after people began to emigrate to space colonies.

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:45.000
The wars that were once fought for control of the Earth Sphere had ended

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.170
and it seemed that an era of peace had arrived.

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:52.670
However, this fleeting peace collapsed.

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:59.800
A colony was destroyed by an unidentified enemy that suddenly appeared.

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:05.980
The curtain was rising on a new battle that would continue over 100 years.

