00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:42.410
Episode 2 
The Power Of AGE

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:52.290
This is our home, Nora.

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:55.170
Nora's center, the colony core, is completely separated

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:58.960
from the residential areas on the inner walls of the colony.

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:02.470
As a result, it has remained virtually undamaged from the attack.

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:05.890
We're going to evacuate the residents here.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:09.970
If we use the loading elevators that connect all the areas

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:13.560
we'll be able to evacuate everyone much faster than using the escape craft.

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:18.190
But all of Nora is undergoing torsional collapse!

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:19.730
That's where the Diva comes in.

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:24.660
We'll connect the Diva to the core, and pull it straight out.

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:29.950
The colony core <i>does</i>  have an independent life support system.

00:04:29.950 --> 00:04:33.080
Yes. Our time limit is 5 hours.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:35.790
We have no room for error, but it's not impossible!

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:38.380
I'm counting on all of you!{Everything depends on your efforts!}

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:39.550
Yes, sir!

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:45.470
Ed, run a simulation of the colony core structure and send it over to me!

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:45.300
Commander...

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:49.640
Please let me update Captain Dian on the situation.

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:46.140
Yes, sir!

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:47.890
Organize a duty post for plasma propulsion.

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:51.350
Honette, advance notice to all duty posts!

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:51.850
All right, I'll leave it to you.

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:56.190
However, I doubt the enemy will keep quiet.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:54.060
Issuing an evacuation order for all civilians!

00:04:56.190 --> 00:05:00.780
Yes, our only hope may be that Gundam...

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:04.860
Don't shove! Don't shove!

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:07.110
<i>Evacuation alert.</i>

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:09.910
<i>All residents should follow instructions</i>

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:13.540
<i>and proceed to the elevator halls leading to the agricultural block.</i>

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:14.620
<i>I repeat.</i>

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:17.290
<i>All residents should follow instructions</i>

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:20.210
<i>and proceed to the elevator halls leading to the agricultural block.</i>

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:22.960
Prioritize the life support-related materials! Everything else can be tossed out!

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:22.960
That's delicate equipment!

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:25.840
5th platoon is heading for Area D!

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:25.840
Don't drive recklessly!

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:29.100
Is it really going to be okay?

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:32.430
Vargas! Where are they taking the AGE Builder?

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:35.350
Don't crowd the vehicles here! Be efficient!

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:35.520
It's being taken aboard a Federation ship.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:37.980
3rd platoon, please relocate closer to the shaft.

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:37.980
After all, we can't let it be destroyed here.

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:39.900
Guide the residents and...

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:39.900
What about the Gundam?

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:41.690
It'll be moved too.

00:05:41.690 --> 00:05:45.860
The AGE System isn't complete without the AGE Builder and the Gundam together.{Teh age system is comprised of the builder and the gundam}

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:46.650
Only load the essentials on the ship.

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:48.320
Take the Gundam to the ship yourself.

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:48.320
We'll leave the vehicles in the military port.

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:49.740
Huh?

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:55.000
Take the beam spray gun and the shield just in case you run into combat.{i like how all the weaponry is in english, amkes it easier}

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.660
I'll follow later.

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:00.330
Run into combat?{to match with earlier line}

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:01.710
Flit!

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:06.010
Make it clear to the mobile suit pilots!

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:06.010
Emily... And Dique, too!

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:07.680
They have to carry all of their own stuff!

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:08.510
Wow!

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:09.470
That includes extra ammunition!

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:11.220
Flit's really piloting a mobile suit... Hey!

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:15.270
Emily, why did you come here?!

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:17.020
Hurry up and go to the elevators!

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:19.350
Aren't you coming, Flit?

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:21.440
Chief! Message from Command!

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:21.440
I have to transport the Gundam to the ship.{more like, on the ship}

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:24.860
If it won't fit the elevators, take it to the port!

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:22.820
Don't tell me...

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:24.860
You're going on the ship too?

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:26.440
I don't know...

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:29.700
But the Gundam won't move without me.

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:30.660
You're joking!

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:34.410
Anyhow, you guys should hurry up and evacuate!

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:35.660
You too, Haro!

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:37.750
You too, you too!

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:39.750
Hey wait, Flit!

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:43.210
Hurry up or you'll be left behind!

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:44.670
Just wait a minute!

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:48.090
Honestly! Don't you know we're worried about you?

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:52.300
But Flit's right. We should head to the elevators...

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:56.720
E-Emily! Where are you going?!

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:59.640
The ship! I can't leave Flit on his own!

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:02.310
What? Th-That's crazy!

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:14.700
At this rate, Nora will be destroyed too.{i'm assuming "too" refers to the other colonies}

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:16.660
Just like last time...

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:18.950
That's...

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:23.670
A person! Did she not evacuate in time?

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:32.590
Just hang on, I'm coming...

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:38.770
Hey, are you okay?

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:45.310
Wh-Why are you running away?

00:07:53.610 --> 00:07:57.080
Hurry up! We can get to the dock from over there!

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:07.920
How do we open this?

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:13.930
What are you children doing here?

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:16.260
This hoistway is military property!

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:19.850
We're trying to get on a ship in the dock...

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:20.930
Don't be ridiculous!

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:24.810
You civilians should hurry up and evacuate to the agricultural block!

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:26.190
Emily!

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:28.820
Opening the hatch.

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:30.280
All right!

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:31.860
Now go!

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:35.110
See, I knew we'd get told off. Let's head back.

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:39.660
You've got to be kidding. We can't just turn back after we've come this far.

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:46.960
Don't tell me... E-Emily?

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:49.170
Emily! Wait!

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:53.920
Emily! Oh for...{acdtulaly i kind of liek this. OH FOR THE LOVE OF GOD}

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:57.720
What did Commander Bruzar say?

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:00.470
It's an idiotic plan.

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:04.810
He wants to pull the core out of the colony, and he expects the Diva to control it!

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:07.900
What shall we do, Captain Fonroid?

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:09.860
We'll ignore him, of course.

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:12.320
Unless we receive orders from central command,

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:15.490
our first priority is to ensure the safety of the ship.

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:16.490
Then...

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:19.780
The Diva will immediately retreat from the dangerous situation at Nora.

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:22.500
They're just gonna abandon the people of Nora?!

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:24.210
But they're the Federation Forces!

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:31.130
Who is it?!

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:35.050
You're Deputy Commander Grodek? {Commander Muttonchops}

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:38.930
You arrived quickly, Captain Dian Fonroid.

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:41.350
I've come to brief you on the plan.

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:44.390
Hmph. You know as well as I do...

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:47.770
We report directly to the Federation Forces Command Center.

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:49.730
We don't take orders from Bruzar.

00:09:49.730 --> 00:09:51.520
Oh, is that so?

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:53.610
Got the message? Then get out of the way!

00:09:57.200 --> 00:10:00.070
Grodek! Y-You bastard!

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:04.250
Don't move. If I raise the output, this thing could kill you. {a bit awkward here}

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:07.290
Are you out of your mind? This is flagrant insubordination!

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:09.960
If this is a crime, then I'll accept the punishment.

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:12.960
Assuming we both survive, that is...

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:16.010
Wh-What's wrong?

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:28.770
Did we just see something we really shouldn't have?

00:10:31.810 --> 00:10:32.770
Roger that.

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:36.490
Commander. We're the only ones left. Let's head for the Diva.

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:39.240
No. I will remain here.

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:40.280
What?!

00:10:40.280 --> 00:10:44.830
This is the only place where we can separate the core from the colony.

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:47.160
It can't be done remotely.

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:48.830
But that's...

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:51.330
Commander, are you saying you intended this from the start?

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:56.880
Don't worry. This base has a special escape route exclusive to commanders.{exclusive for commanders only}

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:59.800
An exclusive...escape route...? {change this also then}

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:02.390
You should go ahead.

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:05.970
Save everyone with the Diva. Save the people of Nora.

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:09.640
I understand, sir.

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:12.730
I leave the Diva in your hands.

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:15.320
Load the Gundam onto it and go forward.{on a journey}

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:18.190
It is humanity's last ray of hope.

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:19.400
Yes, sir!

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:32.630
An exclusive escape route...

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:36.800
I'm surprised I could make that up and say it with a straight face.{eyecatch}

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:51.640
Whoa! Look, Emily!

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:54.360
It's the Federation Forces' newly-built battleship, the Diva!

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:55.310
The Diva?

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:57.520
This is the first time I've seen the real thing!

00:11:57.520 --> 00:11:59.360
It's so big and cool-looking!

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:09.080
Careful, careful...

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:10.500
Grandpa!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:11.460
Hm?

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:15.290
Emily! What are you doing over here?!

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:17.710
Didn't you evacuate to the colony core?

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:21.970
It's a long story. Let us board the ship, too.

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:24.010
H-Hey, Emily!

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:26.470
Don't wander around!

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:28.930
Oh jeez...

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:39.480
Where's the bridge crew?

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:41.030
And Captain Dian?

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:42.610
I'll check...

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:47.910
Huh? That's strange...

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:50.120
I can't bring up the crew data.

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:51.700
What does this mean?

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:57.040
Fine. This is an emergency situation.

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:00.630
We'll launch the Diva even if we have to do it ourselves.

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:02.880
All hands, begin preparations!

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:11.930
Is this all the security information that the military has? {Is this all the security they have?}

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:13.640
I hope you don't mind...

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:18.560
But I'll be taking the Diva into my own hands.

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:29.830
Wait, don't run away!

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:31.450
I'm coming down to you now.

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:35.460
I'm not an enemy!

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:41.710
Are you okay? Do you have any injuries—

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:51.260
Th-That's right, we've got to hurry!

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:53.310
We're running out of time!

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:56.020
Huh? Oh, don't be afraid of that.

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:58.150
I built that Gundam.

00:13:58.600 --> 00:14:00.480
Gun...dam?

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:01.570
That's right!

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:05.240
Let's go. The Gundam will save us, I'm sure.

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:33.600
I-I hope we make it to the ship in time.

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:37.020
I'm sorry about running away from you earlier.

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:38.100
Huh...?

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:40.310
Oh, don't worry about it.

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:43.730
My name's Flit. What's yours?

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:44.860
Yurin.

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:47.740
Yurin, huh... Yurin, why were you...

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:50.990
Why were you in a place like...

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:08.630
It looks like the UE attack is continuing.

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:10.050
Adams.

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:13.350
Is something about this enemy attack unsettling to you?

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:14.300
Something unsettling?

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:17.430
Never mind, it's nothing.

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:20.850
If the enemy's goal was to destroy this colony,

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:24.730
then all they had to do was attack the energy plants.

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:26.020
Then why are they...

00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:32.530
Deputy Commander Grodek?!

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:33.070
No.

00:15:33.700 --> 00:15:36.490
From now on, I'm captain of this ship.

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:37.660
Huh?

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:42.420
We just got a message from the EFF Command Center, Big Ring.

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:46.090
As of today, I've been appointed Captain of the Diva.

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:50.880
The navigation crew and pilots have already boarded, correct?

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:52.430
Y-Yes, sir!

00:15:52.800 --> 00:15:54.760
The Diva will launch immediately.

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:57.310
Start connecting us to the colony core!

00:15:57.310 --> 00:16:00.390
Wait! The Gundam hasn't been brought on board yet!

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:04.770
We're out of time. The Gundam will have to escape Nora on its own.

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:10.820
The Diva is prepared for launch.

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:13.780
All crew working outside the ship are ordered to return.

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:16.580
<i>The Diva is prepared for launch.</i>

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:19.830
<i>All crew working outside the ship are ordered to return.</i>

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:20.950
Launch?! The Gundam isn't on board yet!

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:22.870
Flit...

00:16:24.540 --> 00:16:27.210
<i>Mooring system separation confirmed.</i>

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:31.050
<i>Maintain alert status while moving to launch phase 1.</i>

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:44.560
Are you all right?

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:50.360
It looks like we've fallen down to the bulkhead area on the lowest level.

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:52.780
In that case, we're going to have to bust our way out of here with brute force!

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:01.120
Straight ahead...{oh shit she's a newtype}{spoilers!}

00:17:01.120 --> 00:17:02.580
Huh?

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:04.250
Turn right ahead...

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:06.460
You can tell how to get out?

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:08.670
Yes. You should do as I say. {more like a command than a question}

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:11.210
Okay!

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:16.130
Don't forget that we have very little time left.

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:19.390
All hands, commence procedures for connecting the colony core!

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:21.470
P-Please wait!

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:25.350
We've spotted what appears to be a mobile suit in our current path.

00:17:25.350 --> 00:17:28.110
It's believed to be the same type that attacked Nora!

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:30.270
Suspend the procedures!

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:31.780
Level 1 battle stations!

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:38.370
Wh-What is this?

00:17:40.780 --> 00:17:42.910
No good! It's closed off!

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:44.870
Don't worry, just keep going.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:46.160
Huh?

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:49.290
4, 3, 2...

00:17:49.290 --> 00:17:49.630
1!

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:05.310
W-We made it into space!

00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:13.150
Gundam sighted! It looks like it escaped Nora safely!

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:14.530
It made it!

00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:17.650
It's entering combat against a mobile suit-type UE!

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:26.250
No way!

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:29.580
He made it out, only to run directly into the enemy?!

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:30.830
We can't just stand around!

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:33.750
Now's the time to activate the AGE System!

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:35.590
AGE System?

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:46.020
How can I fight if my beams don't have any effect?

00:18:46.020 --> 00:18:47.600
Flit! Can you hear me?

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:48.440
Vargas!

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:51.610
We haven't done a trial run, but we're activating the AGE System! {we've had no practice, but}

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:56.150
That's right, we have the AGE system! Do we have data on the enemy?

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:59.990
You got enough data during your first battle!

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:02.700
We'll start constructing new weapons right away!

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:04.160
I'm counting on you, Vargas!

00:19:04.990 --> 00:19:08.120
Grandpa, what in the world is the AGE System?

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:12.790
It's an incredible system that Flit created.

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:18.590
It's a mobile suit reconstruction system that's based on the principles of biological evolution.

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:23.720
By experiencing combat, the system comes up with new blueprints to make itself even stronger.

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:26.970
So the system just makes stronger weapons on its own?

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:28.480
That's awesome!

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:31.060
Oh, here it comes!

00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:33.400
Beginning high-speed molding.

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:35.820
AGE Builder, activate!

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:23.530
All right! It's complete!

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:25.240
It's finished already?!

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:26.450
That's right.

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:30.700
The AGE Builder can carve out frames from ingots of raw materials

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:32.210
and assemble them at high speed.

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:33.620
It's amazing...

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:40.340
A beam...rifle?

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:43.010
This is no ordinary beam rifle.

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:47.970
It's a new weapon that increases penetrating power by spinning the trajectory of the beam like a drill!

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:51.390
It's called the DOTS Rifle!

00:20:58.480 --> 00:20:59.570
Flit!

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:02.320
I'm launching a weapon for the Gundam! Be sure to catch it!

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:03.360
Vargas!

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:04.530
Here we go! {this is more slangy, it sounds made-up in jap}{let's kablam this}

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:08.910
It's here!

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:26.470
So this is the DOTS Rifle...

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:33.520
Why, you!

00:21:48.110 --> 00:21:49.370
Wow...

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:51.030
We did it!

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:53.830
The Gundam has destroyed the hostile mobile suit-type!

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:55.160
All right!{chatter}

00:21:55.160 --> 00:21:55.750
We did it!{chatter}

00:21:55.750 --> 00:21:56.750
Yeah!{chatter}

00:21:56.750 --> 00:21:57.960
It's a success!{chatter}

00:21:59.130 --> 00:21:59.920
What's wrong?!

00:21:59.920 --> 00:22:02.170
New targets confirmed!

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:04.340
Incoming enemy mobile suit-types!

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:10.010
There's more?

00:22:10.010 --> 00:22:10.970
No.

00:22:10.970 --> 00:22:11.970
Huh?

00:22:12.510 --> 00:22:13.970
These ones...

00:22:13.970 --> 00:22:16.180
are different...from the last one.

