Next Time

00:23:58.910 --> 00:24:00.870
The time limit approaches.

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:05.040
A desperate mission to save those left behind begins.

00:24:05.040 --> 00:24:09.800
Next time, on Mobile Suit Gundam AGE: The Twisted Colony.

00:24:07.210 --> 00:24:13.010
